  "description": "Reborn into a second life, Edeline envisioned a lifetime of happiness with her fiancé, Shane—until she realized her entire world was a novel, and she was the villainess fated to die. Desperate to live, she faked her death and disappeared. But when she returns years later, the story has become something far darker. Her sweet fiancé is now an obsessive captor determined to never let her go again. Did she escape her scripted death only to find herself trapped in a gilded cage of her own making? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
